      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DECODE ONCE  \u00b7  EMBED ONCE  \u00b7  TAG MANY TIMES\n\nA tag is a sentence, not a trained output head. Frame vectors are\n3.5 MB/hr against 450 MB/hr of video (~128x smaller) \u2014 so re-tagging\nthe entire back catalogue is a dot-product pass, never a re-decode.",
